  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-grindstone-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Grindstone-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>更多磨石变体</h1>\n<p>不仅所有木材类型，还有四种全新的石材变体都将拥有专属磨石。除标准石质磨石外，您还可使用各类砂岩台阶、深板岩台阶、花岗岩台阶以及玄武岩方块。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Grindstone-Variants/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"\">     </p>\n<h2>为《我的世界》增添 59 种全新磨石！</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Grindstone-Variants/pres/cf_desc_crafting_ingredient_table_anim.gif\" alt=\"\"> </p>\n<hr>\n<h1>兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+ 的方块替换功能：</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/fu4b0.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n从武器匠的窗户望向渔夫家的入口：我们可以看到，游戏现在生成村庄时，将用<em><strong>丛林砂岩磨石</strong></em>、<em><strong>丛林火把</strong></em>（来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把变体</a>）、<em><strong>丛林箱子</strong></em>（来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-chest-variants-lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多箱子变体</a>）以及背景中的<em><strong>丛林木桶</strong></em>（来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-barrel-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多木桶变体</a>），替换原有的<em>深色橡木（石）磨石</em>、<em>橡木火把</em>、普通<em>箱子</em>与<em>云杉木桶</em>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
